{title: Maahe Jaan}
{artist: Harshit Saxena Hate Story}
{key: E}

{c: Verse 1}
[E]Dil [Am]Yeh Bezubaan
[C]Kehta [D]Paas Aa [E]Meri Jaan
[E]Mujhko Odh [Am]Le Tu,
[D]Khud Pe [E]Ab Zara
[E]Mere Hosh [Am]Mein Tu,
[D]Duniya [E]Bhool Jaa
[C]Chehra Tera [D]Dil Mein [E]Mahe Jaan
[C]Ho Tu [D]Abar Ban Baras [E]Ja Mahe Jaan
[E]Tera [D]narm saaya [C]mujhko [E]jo mila
[E]Raatein [D]makhmali din [C]resham [E]ho gaya
[C]Pyaasi khwaishon ko, [D]dariya ik mila hai
[C]Dono ke labhon pe [D]aake tham gaya hai
[C]Chehra Tera [D]Dil Mein [E]Mahe Jaan
[C]Ho Tu [D]Abar Ban Baras [E]Ja Mahe Jaan
[E]Neendein [Am]Aaj Karde [D]Aankhon [E]Se Judaa
[E]Yun [Am]Hi Dhadkano [D]Se Rehne [E]De Bandaa
[C]Tera Hi Junoon Hai, [D]Jaane Aisa Kyun Hai
[C]Jisko Dhundta Hun Tujh [D]Me Wo Sukun Hai
[C]Chehra Tera [D]Dil Mein [E]Mahe Jaan
[C]Ho Tu [D]Abar Ban Baras [E]Ja Mahe Jaan
